<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8"/>
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
        <link rel="icon" href="https://linuxcontainers.org/static/img/favicon.ico"/>
        <title>{{ .Title }}</title>
        <style>
            body {
                margin: 0;
                font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
                font-size: 1rem;
                line-height: 1.5;
                color: #212529;
                background-color: #fff;
            }

            nav {
                background-color: #212529;
                padding: 0.5rem 0;
            }

            nav .brand {
                color: #fff;
                font-size: 1.25rem;
                text-decoration: none;
            }

            .container {
                max-width: 1140px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 0 0.75rem;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
                font-weight: 500;
                margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem 0;
            }

            p {
                max-width: 50em;
            }

            a {
                color: #0d6efd;
            }

            table {
                width: 100%;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
                border-collapse: collapse;
            }

            th, td {
                padding: 0.5rem;
                text-align: left;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            }

            thead th {
                border-bottom: 2px solid #212529;
            }

            tbody tr:nth-of-type(odd) {
                background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            }

            .fingerprint {
                cursor: help;
            }

            footer {
                margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;
                padding-top: 1rem;
                border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
                font-size: 0.875rem;
                color: #6c757d;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
            }
        </style>
    </head>

    <body>
        <nav>
            <div class="container">
                <span class="brand">{{ .Title }}</span>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <div class="container">
            <h1>{{ .Title }}</h1>
            <p>This server hosts the images and updates used by IncusOS systems, which automatically fetch their updates from here. To install a new system, use the <a href="https://incusos-customizer.linuxcontainers.org">IncusOS image customizer</a> to download an image preconfigured for your needs.</p>

            <h1>Channels</h1>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Channel</th>
                        <th>Description</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>stable</td>
                        <td>Tested images, this is the channel users are expected to run.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>testing</td>
                        <td>Candidate images for the stable channel, still undergoing validation and so potentially broken.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>daily</td>
                        <td>Completely untested automated builds, intended for developers.</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <h1>Currently available images</h1>
            <p>The latest image in each channel is shown in bold.</p>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Version</th>
                        <th>Published</th>
                        <th>Severity</th>
                        <th>Channels</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
{{- range .Updates }}
                    <tr>
                        <td><a href="{{ .Version }}/">{{ .Version }}</a></td>
                        <td>{{ .Published }}</td>
                        <td>{{ .Severity }}</td>
                        <td>{{ range $i, $channel := .Channels }}{{ if $i }}, {{ end }}{{ if $channel.Latest }}<b>{{ $channel.Name }}</b>{{ else }}{{ $channel.Name }}{{ end }}{{ end }}</td>
                    </tr>
{{- end }}
                </tbody>
            </table>
{{- if .Keys }}

            <h1>Secure Boot keys</h1>
            <p>The Secure Boot certificates below may need to be manually enrolled in the firmware of systems that don't ship with them. All certificates are available in the <a href="keys/">keys</a> directory.</p>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>Description</th>
                        <th>Fingerprint</th>
                        <th>PEM</th>
                        <th>DER</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
{{- range .Keys }}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ .Name }}</td>
                        <td>{{ .Description }}</td>
                        <td><span class="fingerprint" title="SHA256: {{ .Fingerprint }}">&#128273;</span></td>
                        <td>{{ if .PEM }}<a href="keys/{{ .PEM }}">{{ .PEM }}</a>{{ end }}</td>
                        <td>{{ if .DER }}<a href="keys/{{ .DER }}">{{ .DER }}</a>{{ end }}</td>
                    </tr>
{{- end }}
                </tbody>
            </table>
{{- end }}

            <footer>
                <span>Updated at {{ .UpdatedAt }}</span>
                <span><a href="#">Back to top</a></span>
            </footer>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
